* Mood & Vibe: Macabre hysteria, haunted carnival, frantic celebration in the ruins, athletic terror, velvet-and-sawdust dread.

Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: Who Told The Dead Boy To Count To Seven?
- Story & Context: Recorded during the infamous 1994 Sibiu mine wedding, the track opens with the sound of a shattering crystal punch bowl before plunging into a manic 7/8 tapan sprint beneath weeping calliope pipes. Matriarch Elena Petrescu allegedly drew a pearl-handled pistol during the first dance, forcing the horn section to match her erratic pacing as gunpowder smoke stung the nostrils of two hundred guests. Miruna screams over the screeching clarinet duel, her voice cracking as the marriage canopy collapses: "Cover your eyes with dirt and swear you didn't see the ring slip down my throat!"
